      "spam": false,
      "value": "From what I've seen so far. The problem is likely tied to if the world shows up in the Worlds menu front page, it won't show up in the search results. Like 'Jazz Bar with Avatars' used to show up in the search results, but stopped showing up once we got the 'Avatar Worlds' section in the front page. I noticed this on a few other worlds when they are in the 'Community Spotlight'. I think this is likely happening to your world too. \n\nThe patch that added 'Avatar Worlds' and 'Community Spotlight' also added a check so worlds don't show up in 'New' and in 'Community Spotlight' at the same time. This bug might be a side effect of that somehow.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
