  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-03-05T18:42:57.018Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey there! I've been getting reports from multiple people since Friday that people are unable to find my club when they search for \"Club Transcendia\" in the Worlds menu. \n\nI tested it out myself and was able to confirm that nothing comes up when I search for the name, and it also doesn't show up with the rest of the clubs when I use just \"Club\" as the keyword. \"Transcendia\" alone also serves up zero results. \n\nIt shows as public in my worlds list, but that's the only place that it seems to be. My other worlds show up in search however. \n\nI've had people mention to me mine is not the only one, so perhaps something is going wrong behind the scenes. \n\nThanks in advance for looking into this!\n\n- With Love, Christopher (TheArchitect)",
